# Installed agent skills. Third-party tooling, not project source: none of
# it mentions tofig, six of the seven bundled skills ship no license file,
# and vendoring unlicensed work into an MIT repo would relicense code we
# don't own. Personal tooling belongs in ~/.claude/.
#
# A skill written *for* tofig is project knowledge and should be committed.
# When that happens, narrow this to:
#   .claude/*
#   !.claude/skills/tofig-*/
.claude/

# Misc
tmp/
temp/
